	(text "3V3_AO: always-on rail for the RTC and power control"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.018 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "04c63fe8-b699-5f7b-8b98-b3f9a0d61389")
	)
	(text "1.8 V auxiliary (VCCA, VCCADC): 0.6 V x (1 + 20k/10k)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0b6c50b0-0306-529d-abdc-3fcdeb8f7831")
	)
	(text "Notes\n1. 5 V is always present. 3V3_AO is always on; everything else is off in deep sleep.\n2. EN_PWR starts U3; each power-good output enables the next converter (UG040012 2.1:\n   follow the data sheet power-up order; core first, I/O last).\n3. PGOOD (3V3 in regulation) goes to the FPGA as a supply monitor input and switches 5V_SW.\n4. VCC and VCC_DRM share the 1.0 V supply (UG040012 2.3.1).\n5. Capacitor sizes: Table 2-6 calls for 1210 (100u, 47u) and 0805 (4u7); 1206 and 0603\n   parts from the JLCPCB basic list are used here. Place 470n/100n under the BGA.\n6. TLV62569P: 2 A, 1.5 MHz, 2.2 uH. Check the 1.0 V load with Pango Power Planner."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.192 280.162 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d983df3-e900-5025-abe9-ec01320afdfd")
	)
	(text "1.0 V core (VCC, VCC_DRM): 0.6 V x (1 + 20k/30k)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 97.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1a94d829-9cf1-550f-b2c2-34f6b2d19ee5")
	)
	(text "VCCIOCFG: 47u, 470n, 100n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 274.828 148.844 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1b51e7d6-b917-4c6c-a722-ff6a9d7c07dd")
	)
	(text "Gate at +3V3: with the FPGA rail off each FET is off and its body\ndiode is reverse biased, so the always-on side stays high and\nnothing back-feeds the unpowered FPGA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 275.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2c330a11-bcfa-4cef-a2a1-feb0e82f0bce")
	)
	(text "Configuration: MODE[2:0] = 001 (master SPI) strapped on the Base sheet; VCCIOCFG = VCCIOL5 = 3.3 V; SCBV tied to VCCIOCFG.\nJTAG goes to J1 (fixture carrier only; eFuse-locked after enrollment). VCC/VCC_DRM 1.0 V, VCCA 1.8 V, VCCB and VCCADC filtered from 1.8 V on the Base sheet.\nCore/aux decoupling below (UG040012 tables 2-3/2-6 scaled to the 324):\n1V0: 100u + 3 x 4u7 + 4 x 470n + 6 x 100n; 1V8: 2 x 4u7 + 2 x 470n + 3 x 100n; placed at the balls. Check against the table before layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 14.732 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2d26ceed-0fd3-4e09-a591-e5fb5de9c7ca")
	)
	(text "5 V monitor: 0.45 V at VAADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 234.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2e4f9ecc-cdd6-4aa2-919d-dcb3061ac1cd")
	)
	(text "Start: the carrier button (PB_N_AO) or the\nRTC /INT pulls PWR_ON_N low, Q2 charges EN_PWR.\nPower-on: C on PWR_ON_N gives one start pulse\nwhen 5V arrives. \nRun: the boot ROM drives PWR_HOLD high.\nSleep: the loader sets the next alarm and drops PWR_HOLD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.986 87.122 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5e39386b-f3b3-5f13-9ff3-89e075a96f42")
	)
	(text "XC6206: 1 uA quiescent, 6 V max input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 90.17 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "62a9f1e9-5d7e-5314-9d41-2a31e42e8102")
	)
	(text "Isolation between the FPGA (switched 3V3) and the always-on domain"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.748 192.278 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "69292e2e-9b8c-4d37-b554-8281adf1e251")
	)
	(text "Step-downs, sequenced 1V0 -> 1V8 -> 3V3 through the power-good chain"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 93.218 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "718e22d3-cd76-5a8d-bafa-5c9a879f4da1")
	)
	(text "Power control: EN_PWR = power button | RTC alarm | PWR_HOLD (FPGA)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 42.418 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "efcdbe86-89d8-5749-a4f5-1c82498af2a6")
	)
	(text "3.3 V I/O and peripherals: 0.6 V x (1 + 68k/15k) = 3.32 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
